From af37c09fc2f7dbdc13add904ccf100edbb73780b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:46:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: guided tournament setup flow (hub with search +
 step-by-step wizard)

- /tournaments hub after login: search existing tournaments, list your own, create new
- /tournaments/new wizard: basics, format, scoring, rounds, breaks, public/feedback, review
- Creates tournament, rounds and break categories atomically (Firestore transaction) with slug availability check
- Reserved slugs blocked; new tournaments are always owned by the signed-in user
- Login/register default to /tournaments; sanitise ?next= to same-site paths
- Remove old single-step create modal from the home page
